<title>UK: BNG sets 500 mln guilder bond due December 2001.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 500 mln guilder bond due December 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    31.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.085   PAY DATE    02.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.46     SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-5-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
